scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py), the owner's case:
# a loose bunch of 10, wider than deep (16 cells across, 8 deep), slow bodies mostly in front, Aramon Knights
# (fast 3x3, speed 2.9) and Swordsmen (slow 2x2, 1.10) mixed, sent with ONE right-click to one
# point about 1000 px from the click's centre, as a player sends a mixed selection. Asset-free.
# Open field, move order.
name overtake-click-bunch-1000
ticks 3000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 54,78
group S1 0 slow 1 cells 59,78
group S2 0 slow 1 cells 64,78
group F3 0 fast 1 cells 56,82
group F4 0 fast 1 cells 61,82
group S5 0 slow 1 cells 66,82
group F6 0 fast 1 cells 53,86
group S7 0 slow 1 cells 58,86
group F8 0 fast 1 cells 63,86
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 67,86
at 5 move S0,S1,S2,F3,F4,S5,F6,S7,F8,F9 60 20
